<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- One operator envelope, two ISO messages of different families: a pacs.028
     status request and then a camt.056 cancellation request. Both name their
     transaction <TxInf>, which is the shape ADR 0004 was written about - a
     container flag that latches instead of scoping makes read_pacs028 emit the
     cancellation as a second status request, every request-specific column NULL,
     and read_camt056 emit the status request as a cancellation. Each reader owes
     exactly one row here. -->
